expected_result: "Canonical full-list requests have no --full migration hint, while caller-supplied --full remains attributed with extensions active."
actual_result: "Pre-fix regression failed with false --full; linked snapshot test and fresh temporary CLI extension both pass. Full suite: 9405 passed, exact coverage 100/100/100/100."
